flowchart TD
    A[Applicable Control]
    --> B[Execute Control]

    B --> C{Control Passed?}

    C -- Yes --> D[Record Pass Evidence]

    C -- No --> E{Approved Exception Exists?}

    E -- No --> F[Block Workflow]

    E -- Yes --> G{Exception Valid and Unexpired?}

    G -- No --> F

    G -- Yes --> H[Record Exception Evidence]

    H --> I[Continue Under Exception]

    D --> J[Next Control]
    I --> J
